    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Edge0-AI/Edge0/tarball/v0.2.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Edge0-AI/Edge0/zipball/v0.2.0",
    "body": "Windows only. Both packages are built from `3203c39` on `main`. Installation and troubleshooting: see `README.md` inside each package.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n- **Edge0 145B and Edge0 120B.** Two latent-MoE models for a single NVIDIA GPU, run by edge0-strata.\r\n- **New inference engine, edge0-infer.** A single on-device MoE engine in C++ on GGML, with one native API, replaces the Python framework and the four separate platform apps. It includes a CLI (`run`, `chat`, `bench`, `serve`, `info`), an OpenAI-compatible local server and the Edge0 Chat desktop app. This release supports Edge0 35B; Edge0 8B follows in a later release. \r\n- **Anthropic Messages API.** The local server also answers `POST /v1/messages` and `POST /v1/messages/count_tokens` for native models, and LAN authentication accepts `x-api-key`. (#180)\r\n\r\n## Windows x64\r\n\r\n`edge0-chat-0.2.0-windows-x64.zip`\r\n\r\n- Edge0 35B runs on the CPU (AVX2) or on a GPU through Vulkan.\r\n- Edge0 145B and Edge0 120B run on an NVIDIA GPU (CUDA) of compute capability 7.5 or newer (RTX 20 / 30 / 40 / 50) with at least 16 GiB of GPU memory, 20 GiB of system memory, and the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13 installed.\r\n\r\nSHA256: `c7146b76d51c7986723b81a3643893e1ccbb09ce4f365a5090dc99e476bb31b9`\r\n\r\n## Windows Arm64\r\n\r\n`edge0-chat-0.2.0-windows-arm64.zip`\r\n\r\n- Edge0 35B runs on the CPU or on a GPU through Vulkan.\r\n- Edge0 145B and Edge0 120B run on an NVIDIA GPU (CUDA) of compute capability 12.1, such as the NVIDIA RTX Spark N1X, with at least 16 GiB of GPU memory, 20 GiB of system memory, and the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13 for Windows Arm64 installed. The CUDA code is built for `sm_121` only.\r\n\r\nSHA256: `f64accb2c963058bc4ff1c9b064ccb35dc62ccdf8881b9a797d1ddab136f500a`\r\n\r\n## Models\r\n\r\nModel weights are not included in the packages.\r\n\r\n- Edge0 145B: [Edge0-145B-NVFP4](https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Edge0-145B-NVFP4), [Edge0-145B-q3k](https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Edge0-145B-q3k)\r\n- Edge0 120B: [Edge0-120B-NVFP4](https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Edge0-120B-NVFP4), [Edge0-120B-q3k](https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Edge0-120B-q3k)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Edge0-AI/Edge0/compare/v0.1.1...v0.2.0\r\n\n\n"
