    "body": "Android only. macOS and iOS remain the 0.1.0 builds.\n\n## Android (arm64, Android 13+)\n\n`edge0-0.1.1-android-arm64.apk`\n\nBuilt from `d4a2fa02fcf0` on `main`, which includes https://github.com/Edge0-AI/Edge0/pull/155. versionName 0.1.1 (versionCode 2), arm64-v8a only. Signed with the same certificate as 0.1.0, so it can replace that install. Not published on Google Play. Allow installation from this source, then open the APK.\n\nModels has Import. Choose a `.gguf` and the app copies it into its private storage. USB debugging is not required. For 8B, import `lora_edge0_8b-gguf.gguf` the same way, then load the model.\n\nSHA256: `a4cf0253f0d8169948cad8688a7cac6e5d1b500994f95558d03a9a8f96a546a2`\n\nSigning certificate SHA-256: `bd2ea50337e879bdc190041765877f949ae9ad959aaf27c7255e5e8a8a714e26`"
