    "body": "macOS and Android are built from `7a203f2` on `main`. The iOS IPA also includes `bf267d4`, which lets the app read a model copied in through the Files app.\n\n## macOS (Apple Silicon)\n\n`edge0-0.1.0-arm64.zip`\n\nThis machine has no Developer ID Application certificate and no notarization credentials, so the app is ad-hoc signed. Gatekeeper will block it after download. After unzipping, clear the quarantine attribute, then open it:\n\n```bash\nxattr -dr com.apple.quarantine edge0-0.1.0-arm64.app\nopen edge0-0.1.0-arm64.app\n```\n\nSHA256: `6e7824230d5201c02bc0a192969841e0ad19482c7847030220aa0f4db7ca34fb`\n\n## Android (arm64, Android 13+)\n\n`edge0-0.1.0-android-arm64.apk`\n\nversionName 0.1.0 (versionCode 1), arm64-v8a only. Signed for sideloading, not published on Google Play. Allow installation from this source, then open the APK.\n\nModel weights are not in the package. After install, copy a converted GGUF in with the in-app picker (`files/models/`), or stage one with `android/tools/model/push_models.sh`. See `android/README.md` section 1.4.\n\nSHA256: `6ed9e44b912216c99bc05986a549dbc574b22adc2c6a35ee7bdd5e6129d43196`\n\nSigning certificate SHA-256: `bd2ea50337e879bdc190041765877f949ae9ad959aaf27c7255e5e8a8a714e26`\n\n## iOS (iPhone, iOS 17+)\n\n`edge0-0.1.0-ios.ipa`\n\nUnsigned sideload build, bundle id `com.example.edge0phone`, app version 1.0 (1). Install with Sideloadly, AltStore, or SideStore and your own Apple ID; the tool re-signs the IPA. A free Apple ID signature lasts about 7 days.\n\nModel weights are not in the package. After install, connect the phone and copy a model into the app's documents with Finder:\n\n- 8B: `Edge0-8B-A1B-preview/` containing `model.safetensors`\n- 35B: `repacked/` containing `model.safetensors.index.json`, `tokenizer.bin`, and `experts-L00.bin` through `experts-L39.bin`\n\nThe folder can sit directly in the app's documents, or under `Models/`.\n\nSHA256: `7083ff771019ec4dc1f283c5de83794b6d227bdb950a9a961864ead58